pending (i.e., `check_ots` returns `None`)
3. If it's pending and the Sigstore attestation time is more than H hours ago, 
exit 1 with message "still pending N h" where N is the whole number of hours 
since the attestation
4. If it's pending but younger than H hours, exit 0
5. Without the option, behavior unchanged (pending proofs accepted)

